    "REASON: The proposed communications hub and its associated advertisement displays by reason of its height, width, illuminance, siting on the highway and prominent overall location would increase visual clutter and would have a harmful impact on the character and appearance of the surrounding area and the streetscene. The proposal would therefore be contrary to policies D3, D4 and T2 of the London Plan (2021), policies PLAN1, SP5, DH6, T4 and ST3 of Islington's Strategic and Development Management Policies (2023) and the guidance contained within Islington's Urban Design Guide (2017)."
